@startuml
title How the game runs one prologue text (observed in DeSmuME)

start
:0x04 LoadImage [pro_NN, pro_NN_obj]
load Pro_NN.narc;
:0x00 TransitionBefore (hi = frames);
:0x08 Text
typewriter starts, ~4.1 frames per character;
repeat
  :0x02 ShowImage (value = frames)
  image / animation shown, typing continues;
  note right
    animation longer than value: cut off
    loop mode (2) and value longer: animation restarts
    once mode (1) and value longer: holds last frame
  end note
  :0x01 TransitionAfter / 0x00 TransitionBefore (hi = frames);
repeat while (next group contains 0x09?) is (no: montage, text stays)
->yes;
:group with 0x09 ClearText
text is cleared, next image is loaded;
stop

legend right
  text on screen = sum(Image values) + transitions between them
  readable time  = on screen - 4.1 * characters
  editor suggests 4 * characters + 240 frames
endlegend
@enduml